<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank meeting ends, no rate changes announced.</title>
<headline>Riksbank meeting ends, no rate changes announced.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, ended its board meeting on Thursday without announcing any changes to its deposit, lending or repo rates.</p>
<p>The repo rate is currently set at 4.60 percent, and the deposit and lending rates are 4.25 percent and 5.75 percent respectively.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
